v][k] + cnt) % mod;\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // Prefix sums over j dimension\n        long[][][] S_dp = new long[n+1][n+1][m+1];\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n                long cumsum = 0;\n                for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {\n                    cumsum = (cumsum + dp[i][j][k]) % mod;\n                    S_dp[i][k][j] = cumsum;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        // Prefix sums over k dimension\n        long[][][] SS_dp = new long[n+1][m+1][n+1];\n        for (int i = 0; i <= n; i++) {\n            for (int j = 0; j <= m; j++) {\n                long cumsum = 0;\n                for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n                    cumsum = (cumsum + S_dp[i][k][j]) % mod;\n                    SS_dp[i][j][k] = cumsum;\n                }\n            }\n        }\n        \n        long[] ANS = new long[n+1];\n        for (int i = 1; i <= n; i++) {\n            long ans = i * ANS[i-1] % mod;\n            for (int k = 0; k <= n; k++) {\n                for (int j = 1; j <= m; j++) {\n                    if (dp[i][j][k] == 0) continue;\n                    long diff = (SS_dp[i][j-1][n] - SS_dp[i][j-1][k] + mod) % mod;\n                    ans = (ans + dp[i][j][k] * diff) % mod;\n                }\n            }\n            ANS[i] = ans;\n        }\n        \n        System.out.println(ANS[n] % mod);\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-8.844937838148326e-05, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.00014661667228210717, -5.9960475482512265e-05, -0.5759427547454834, -0.393645316362381, -3.3378546504536644e-06, -8.344646857949556e-07, -3.0040289857424796e-05, -0.03804382309317589, -8.5588610090781e-05, -0.2967289984226227, -1.6689286894688848e-06, -0.0005055579822510481, -5.8412379075889476e-06, -2.861018856492592e-06, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -9.738924563